  m_text: "<size=100><b>Region 1: Squaring the Binomial</b></size>\n\n<align=center>Oh
    no! The cannon needs an <b>STB Neutralizing Shell (SNS)</b> to lessen the bomb's
    impact! \n\nBy following the <b>\"Squaring the Binomial\"</b> We can open the
    case containing the SNS Shell!\n\nPlease Help us Dear Savior!</align>\n\n\n\n\n\n<i><size=0.8em><align=center>Touch
    Screen to Close</align></size></i>"
